    <string name="hk_code_scan_hint">Point your camera at the square to enter it automatically.</string>
    <string name="hk_code_starting">Starting HomeKit — the code will appear in a moment…</string>
    <string name="hk_pending_title">Not paired yet</string>
    <string name="hk_pending_body">HomeKit is on and this TV is visible to the Home app. You can finish adding it whenever you like — the code stays the same. To see these instructions again, go to Settings and choose HomeKit setup.</string>
    <string name="hk_code_unavailable">No code yet — HomeKit is still starting. Go back and try again in a moment.</string>
    <string name="hk_uncertified_note">iOS will warn that this is an uncertified accessory. That is expected: PhairPlay is not an Apple-licensed product. Choose Add Anyway.</string>
